<title>SWEDEN: TENNIS-ENQVIST LEADS BOETSCH 6-4 6-3- DAVIS CUP LATEST.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-ENQVIST LEADS BOETSCH 6-4 6-3- DAVIS CUP LATEST.</headline>
<dateline>MALMO, Sweden 1996-11-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Latest score in the second</p>
<p>singles of the Davis Cup final between Sweden and France on</p>
<p>Friday:</p>
<p>Thomas Enqvist (Sweden) leads Arnaud Boetsch (France) 6-4 6-3</p>
<p>Earlier result: Cedric Pioline (France) beat Stefan Edberg</p>
<p>(Sweden) 6-3 6-4 6-3</p>
<p>France lead tie 1-0</p>
</text>
